close_reason: "Invalidation propagates forward to descendants naming the nearest invalidated ancestor, and the environment check is memoized across heads. Head enumeration derives the lineage edge from the specification parent rather than the pm parent field, skips an unreadable generation before it joins the id list so one malformed body cannot fail the view for every ancestry, and reads a parent identity that parseGenerationSpec has already trimmed."
